&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Fixes &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2253&quot; title=&quot;Piechart rendering issue when column selected as &amp;#39;key&amp;#39; is changed&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-2253&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-2253&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;When pie chart&apos;s key(domain) is changed, this error is logged:&lt;br/&gt;
     &apos;Uncaught TypeError: arcs&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;idx&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; is not a function at pie.js:358&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Even if we change key and values, chart remains broken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Fix: set this.chart to null, which inturn makes this.render to&lt;br/&gt;
    intialize a new chart constructor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


